  Card Parser Bot — Setup Guide
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

1. Create a bot via @BotFather on Telegram → copy the token

2. Set your token:
   • Local:   set environment variable  BOT_TOKEN=your_token
   • Railway: Variables → add  BOT_TOKEN = your_token

3. Deploy on Railway:
   • New project → Deploy from GitHub (or upload files)
   • Railway auto-detects Dockerfile and builds it
   • Add BOT_TOKEN variable → deploy

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  WHAT THE BOT DOES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PASTE CARDS (any format):
  Send a message or .txt file with cards in any format:
    4111111111111111|12|26|123
    4111111111111111:12:2026:123
    4111111111111111 12 26 123
    4111111111111111/12/26/123

  → Bot returns ONLY:  4111111111111111|12|26|123
    No bank name, no BIN info, nothing extra.
  → ≤ 15 cards: shown as text
  → > 15 cards: sent as cards.txt file

FILTER BY BIN:
  /cards 4111        → returns only cards starting with 4111
  /cards 411111      → returns only cards starting with 411111
  /cards 5           → returns only Mastercards (starting with 5)

  Works on the last batch you pasted or uploaded.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
